  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Joseph gathered corn as the sand of the sea, Gen. 41:49. let them go and gather straw for themselves, Ex. 5:7. he that gathered much had nothing, Ex. 16:18 (2 Cor. 8:15). gather in the fruits thereof, Ex. 23:10 (Lev. 25:3). neither shalt thou gather the gleanings, Lev. 19:9 (23:22). man that gathered sticks upon the sabbath day, Num. 15:32. shalt not gather the grapes, Deut. 28:30. gather to me all Israel unto mount Carmel, 1 Kgs. 18:19. gather us … from the heathen, 1 Chr. 16:35 (Ps. 106:47). gathereth her food in the harvest, Prov. 6:8. He that gathereth in summer is a wise son, Prov. 10:5. he shall gather the lambs with his arm, Isa. 40:11. cast up the highway; gather out the stones, Isa. 62:10. I will also gather all nations, Joel 3:2.",
